---
// Drawn mockups of common ClickFix lures. Deliberately generic: no real logos or brand names.
---

<ul class="lures">
  <li>
    <div class="shot shot-check" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="chk-card">
        <span class="chk-box"></span>
        <span>Verify you are human</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chk-steps">
        <p>Verification steps</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Press <b>Win</b> + <b>R</b></li>
          <li>Press <b>Ctrl</b> + <b>V</b></li>
          <li>Press <b>Enter</b></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="cap"><strong>A human check</strong> that “fails” and asks you to verify by pasting.</p>
  </li>

  <li>
    <div class="shot shot-error" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="err-icon">!</div>
      <p class="err-title">This page can’t be displayed</p>
      <p class="err-sub">A font or plugin is missing.</p>
      <span class="err-btn">Copy fix</span>
    </div>
    <p class="cap"><strong>A browser or document error</strong> with a “fix” to copy.</p>
  </li>

  <li>
    <div class="shot shot-call" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="call-tiles"><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div class="call-alert">
        <p>Microphone not detected</p>
        <span>Fix and join</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="cap"><strong>A video call that won’t connect</strong> until you “fix” your mic or camera.</p>
  </li>

  <li>
    <div class="shot shot-update" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="upd-spinner"></div>
      <p>Working on updates 98%</p>
      <p class="upd-small">To finish, press Win + R, then Ctrl + V</p>
    </div>
    <p class="cap"><strong>A fake Windows update</strong> that takes over the whole screen.</p>
  </li>
</ul>

<p class="also">
  Also seen: file-sharing pages that ask you to paste a “file path” into File Explorer, and Microsoft sign-ins that
  ask you to paste a link back into the page.
</p>

<style>
  .lures {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 15rem), 1fr));
    gap: 2rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .shot {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #c4c9cf;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-family: var(--ui);
  }

  .cap {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .also {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* Human check */
  .shot-check {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #f6f7f9;
  }

  .chk-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid #d3d7dc;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .chk-box {
    width: 1.1rem;
    height: 1.1rem;
    border: 2px solid #8b939c;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .chk-steps {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--lure);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .chk-steps p {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .chk-steps ol {
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  /* Browser error */
  .shot-error {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .err-icon {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e9ebee;
    color: #5b636d;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .err-title {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .err-sub {
    color: #5b636d;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .err-btn {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--lure);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Video call */
  .shot-call {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    background: #202428;
  }

  .call-tiles {
    height: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .call-tiles span {
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #353b42;
  }

  .call-alert {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 50% 1.25rem auto;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.7rem;
    background: #fff;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .call-alert p {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .call-alert span {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--lure);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  /* Windows update */
  .shot-update {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #0f4c8a;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .upd-spinner {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    border: 3px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.3);
    border-top-color: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .upd-small {
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.75);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }
</style>
